As you dig into some delicious lamb chops, the girl excuses herself to gather more food.
All alone, something tugs at your heartstrings as you recall her past\:
A poor child, forsaken and sold by her parents to the royal family.
And yet, her courage was how she climbed the ranks to become the Imperial Shogun...
...all without harboring a single drop of resentment in her pure heart.
A deep desire bubbles up, to be a cool sword girl living in this quaint house in a quaint field.
